    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
        <h1>EXHIBIT G</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 18px; margin: 15px 0;">TO THE</p>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border: none;">CONCESSION AGREEMENT FOR THE CAN GIO INTERNATIONAL TRANSSHIPMENT PORT</h2>
        <p style="margin: 30px 0;"><strong>CONSORTIUM AGREEMENT</strong></p>
        <p>(Incorporated by reference into the Concession Agreement dated April 2026, Agreement No. MOT‑CG‑2026‑001)</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">DATED: APRIL 2026</p>
    </div>

